    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">\u2014\u2014Searching for the final anchor of humanity amidst the cracks of civilization ruins</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">What you need to do is survive in the post apocalyptic era.</span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u258dPioneering gameplay: Explore and collect for survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595760/extras/c9057cb8570a7a1bf4d77e6c566a473b.avif?t=1745279131\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reasonably plan your itinerary and take the most appropriate path with minimal cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595760/extras/ab359cbd63caf18375a82e5ddd8a25fb.avif?t=1745279131\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the location and search for items that can help you survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u258dStruggling narrative: Trading friendly</strong>\u00a0<strong>killing</strong> <strong>for survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Negotiating with humans who have temporarily survived by chance, trading items, becoming friends, or... killing them, no matter what, is all for survival</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u258dDisaster World: Zombies, Zombies, Zombies for survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595760/extras/32a513d326740b8704954c2c0257930d.avif?t=1745279131\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware of those zombies, don't become their food. In the rhythm, pick up weapons such as knives, pistols, and even magical items that can make you flash. No matter what you pick up, use it wisely and fight against zombies to the end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595760/extras/1c6affea6e4c3bb97efa7f076eb9aa78.avif?t=1745279131\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Where is our way out? I heard that humans have built a never-ending train, the Hope train, perhaps that is the only way to survive</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">&gt;&gt;On December 24th, 20x6, your name has been printed on the train ticket&lt;&lt;</span></p>",
