tems that can make you flash. No matter what you pick up, use it wisely and fight against zombies to the end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595760/extras/1c6affea6e4c3bb97efa7f076eb9aa78.avif?t=1745279131\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Where is our way out? I heard that humans have built a never-ending train, the Hope train, perhaps that is the only way to survive</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">&gt;&gt;On December 24th, 20x6, your name has been printed on the train ticket&lt;&lt;</span></p>",
